 "form-vs-software.16k.wav": {
  "text": "Same patient, same referral, two very different endings. On the left, a web form. You hit submit and it turns into an email in somebody's inbox. No confirmation, no status. Did anyone call the patient? Nobody knows. On the right, tooth referral, the referral lands as a case with the x-rays and the insurance attached. The specialist team sees it right away and every step is logged, received, contacted, consultation scheduled. The general dentist sees each update and can message the specialist right on the case. When treatment is done, a signed completion note goes back automatically. A web form sends an email. Tooth referral starts a tracked shared case and it takes about five minutes to set up.",
